sec.p:
The reconstruction of f(x) is done by trying to find a function fr in the intersection of the following sets:
E1 ≔ {f̃ ∈ L2 (ℝ) : f̃(x) = f(x) ∀x ∈ (−.55, −.45) ∪ (.45, .55)}
E2 ≔ {f̃ ∈ L2 (ℝ) : f̃(x) = 0 ∀x ∉ (−.di, di)}
E3 ≔ {f̃ ∈ L2 (ℝ) : f̃(x) ≤ 0}
E4 ≔{f̃ ∈ L2 (ℝ) : |Hf̃(x) − gm(x)| ≤ ε ∀x ∈ (−1, 1)}
E5≔{f˜∈L2(ℝ):∫−didif˜(x)dx=Rmμ(s,π2)}
